"Build and run a Qiskit Function template for electronic structure simulation"
" with an implicit solvent model {#build-and-run-a-qiskit-function-template-"
"for-electronic-structure-simulation-with-an-implicit-solvent-model}"
msgstr ""
"بناء وتشغيل قالب دالة Qiskit لمحاكاة البنية الإلكترونية مع نموذج المذيب "
"الضمني {#build-and-run-a-qiskit-function-template-for-electronic-structure-"
"simulation-with-an-implicit-solvent-model}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
